  "uuid": "a6c09a7a-06a3-415e-bc96-056aa1293cdb",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "c898ab91-4c34-9788-9990-7c33df60dfef",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "6445246c-6000-b75c-d7bc-dd0c471c2a17",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "1. Have online access to important documents, eliminating the need for the systems to be people-dependent. Authorized people can access the project documents from anywhere in the world;",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "2. It also means that as soon as records are created and added to the system, everybody within the organization that needs access to them can see them immediately without having to chase people or wait for them to respond.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The online system will provide access to the faculty members,  research administrators and other support units, who wishes to review any documents pertaining to the grants. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
